WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.820
25,000 Korean bank customers had data leaked, and the president ordered a probe. This is Omni View Asia Pacific,

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:15.220
ECSO 12. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. President Lee Jae-miung got that briefing on Sunday.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.960
Spokesperson Kang Yoo-jong told Yeon-hap. The breaches sit at financial firms and at public institutions,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:27.040
and he told officials to treat them as serious and to put real effort into a fix.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:32.380
Honda Bank, KB Cookman Bank, and Shinhan Bank are among the firms named.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:38.220
Shinhan said on Thursday, the stolen fields include names, phone numbers, and annual income.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.320
Sources told Yamhop the attackers used advanced artificial intelligence tools.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.920
89 Honda customers had personal information taken.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.840
Worry Bank and NH Nong Hub Bank were hit the same way.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.880
Stopped the unauthorized access and say nothing personal got out.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:01:00.560
Financial Services Commission Chairman Lee E. Aug-Wan and Financial Supervisory Service

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:05.800
Governor Lee Chon-jin sat down in an emergency meeting with the heads of the firms involved.

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:11.360
Lee E. Aug-Wan said the breaches also reached savings banks and specialized credit finance

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:13.920
firms, packed into a short stretch of time.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:19.240
He said data that could drive unauthorized payments does not appear to have left and

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:23.980
he still wants the highest vigilance because what did leave could feed voice fishing and

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:29.200
other scams. He also left open the chance that artificial intelligence tools were part of the

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:36.120
attacks. Across the region, India lifted the ceiling on deep water gas to $9.89 per million

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:43.400
British thermal units. Up from $8.90, redift money whiz reports. Gas from older fields under

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:51.020
the APM system stays capped at $7 for the same unit. New wells from ONGC and OIL can bring as much

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.460
as $7.70, a rate meant to pull investment.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.120
The higher deep water ceiling is there to drop

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.140
production from hard offshore fields,

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.500
