chemical over suspected dumping, voice of Emirates reports. In the wider world, Okinawa

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:16.080
prefectural police say 20-year-old US marine Daven Ballard, based at Futema, was arrested

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:22.020
Sunday on suspicion of killing Anna Yagi, 39, and taking her wallet and backpack in the early

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:28.180
hours of Saturday at a hotel in Naha, the South China Morning Post reports. Police say he was

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:33.580
seen going into the hotel with Yagi, who was found dead on Saturday morning, and that he has denied

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:39.280
the charges. The New York Times reports Japan protested after US Marine was accused of killing

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:45.560
a woman in Okinawa. Takaichi pressed the United States after the arrest. US officials say a marine

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:50.980
was detained in connection with a death in Japan. The case on both sides of mandatory confiscation

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:56.900
starts with a court urging, not a new statute. Just as B. Pughalendi of the Madurai Bench of

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:01.680
the Madras High Court told the Hindu that the Prevention of Corruption Act needs amendments

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:06.480
so attachment and confiscation are mandatory for property believe to come from corrupt means,

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:12.660
or from wealth out of line with known income. His reason for the change is that the 1988 act

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.940
should do more than punish people found guilty.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.980
It should also stop them enjoying or selling what was acquired illegally.

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:22.460
He called attachment an important piece of that machinery,

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:27.140
and the court said corruption has to be treated more seriously than any other offense

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:29.620
because it has reached every part of society.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:33.180
Only mandatory deterrent rules, the court said,

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.580
let the government actually attach property

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:39.840
and put fear into officials who still enjoy what was obtained through corrupt means.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:45.140
The reason to leave the act alone, as the court describes the law now, is that punishment

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:47.080
of the guilty is already its job.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:52.380
The bench says that without a mandatory rule, those attachment provisions would sit on paper,

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:57.620
with no deterrent effect, an illegally acquired property could still be enjoyed or sold.

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:03.300
The judgment treats a shared ground that the act already targets corrupt practices, and

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.420
that attachment is already part of the mechanism.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:09.280
The court hopes the government will move and bring in suitable amendments.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:13.160
